d & large double detached garage. Just blocks from Meadowlark Health & Shopping Centre, schools, transit & amenities, with easy access to West Edmonton Mall. Move in & enjoy, renovate over time, or bring your vision to this exceptionally well-cared-for home! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$425,000"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bungalow"],["Bedrooms","4"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","1,049 sq ft"],["Lot size","5,500 sq ft"],["Year built","1962"],["Storeys","1"],["Neighbourhood","Meadowlark Park"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5R4N5"],["MLS® number","E4503318"],["Listed","August 12, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Stove, Dryer, Window Coverings, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","4.15 m × 4.73 m (13'7\" × 15'6\")"],["Dining room","Main level","2.22 m × 2.71 m (7'3\" × 8'11\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","3.40 m × 4.16 m (11'2\" × 13'8\")"],["Den","Basement","3.25 m × 3.14 m (10'8\" × 10'4\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","3.37 m × 3.14 m (11'1\" × 10'4\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","3.14 m × 2.66 m (10'4\" × 8'9\")"],["Bedroom 3","Main level","2.79 m × 3.31 m (9'2\" × 10'10\")"],["Bedroom 4","Basement","3.81 m × 3.63 m (12'6\" × 11'11\")"],["Recreation room","Basement","3.81 m × 5.93 m (12'6\" × 19'5\")"],["Utility room","Basement","3.30 m × 4.10 m (10'10\" × 13'5\")"]],"courtesy":"Allison McDougall, REMAX River City","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"meadowlark-park","area":"west-edmonton"}